(7691453, 1260425, 103142, '<td valign="top">Great take on the subject! I like the painting better than the photo. The photo is nice, but the lighting seems off on it, somehow. However, the painting is awesome! 7 for the photo -- but I would have given the painting a 9. :)</td>', 'Great take on the subject! I like the painting better than the photo. The photo is nice, but the lighting seems off on it, somehow. However, the painting is awesome! 7 for the photo -- but I would have given the painting a 9. :)', '2021-04-09 23:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
