(7691459, 1260443, 3306, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Lydia:</b></div><hr/><i> This is charming!    In an... uh... fire kinda way!  LOL!<br/> <br/>I''m loving it!<br/> <br/>I''m searching for the bowl. <br/> <br/>I''ll come back later to find it. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Synonym for bowl is basin . That is a sink bowl  or sink basin! It appears that several voters did not feel that was acceptable. I knew there would be those who wouldnt see it that way but I chose to do it anyway.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2021-04-10 04:30:12.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Lydia: This is charming!    In an... uh... fire kinda way!  LOL! I''m loving it! I''m searching for the bowl.  I''ll come back later to find it.   Synonym for bowl is basin . That is a sink bowl  or sink basin! It appears that several voters did not feel that was acceptable. I knew there would be those who wouldnt see it that way but I chose to do it anyway.', '2021-04-10 04:54:49.000000', '2021-04-10 05:30:12.000000', 0),
(7691460, 1260425, 3306, '<td valign="top">You are so multi-talented! Dont downplay the painting as it is quite good! Congrats on a very creativel and imaginative picture. A well deserved blue ribbon.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2021-04-10 04:57:30.</i></td>', 'You are so multi-talented! Dont downplay the painting as it is quite good! Congrats on a very creativel and imaginative picture. A well deserved blue ribbon.', '2021-04-10 05:16:46.000000', '2021-04-10 05:57:30.000000', 0),
(7691461, 1260477, 3306, '<td valign="top">Not an easy challenge to bring all the elements into a believable and original concept. It made me smile! Congrats on the red .</td>', 'Not an easy challenge to bring all the elements into a believable and original concept. It made me smile! Congrats on the red .', '2021-04-10 05:19:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(7691462, 1260445, 3306, '<td valign="top">Great composition. It is a perfect example of your wonderful artistry. Congrats on  4th.</td>', 'Great composition. It is a perfect example of your wonderful artistry. Congrats on  4th.', '2021-04-10 05:24:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(7691463, 1260466, 3306, '<td valign="top">Well done Henk. I like that you chose to use B&amp;W. It helps to define the elements of the challenge without making any element more important than the rest.</td>', 'Well done Henk. I like that you chose to use B&W. It helps to define the elements of the challenge without making any element more important than the rest.', '2021-04-10 05:28:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(7691464, 1260464, 3306, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your first entry in DPC. I hope you will find this experience both fun and an opportunity to learn. Please accept my opinion as only that. There are many minds on this website who see things very differently so take the comments and criticisms only as an opportunity to grow and see how others perceive your work. Overall I like your composition. It is well arranged, colorful and satisfies all the elements of the challenge. I feel though that you have some unnecessary elements included which make the picture feel cluttered. I personally would like to see the background in better focus as they are also important in the composition. Finally, help to define your image with a title. It helps the viewer to understand your purpose. I look forward to seeing more of your entries:)</td>', 'Congratulations on your first entry in DPC. I hope you will find this experience both fun and an opportunity to learn. Please accept my opinion as only that. There are many minds on this website who see things very differently so take the comments and criticisms only as an opportunity to grow and see how others perceive your work. Overall I like your composition. It is well arranged, colorful and satisfies all the elements of the challenge. I feel though that you have some unnecessary elements included which make the picture feel cluttered. I personally would like to see the background in better focus as they are also important in the composition. Finally, help to define your image with a title. It helps the viewer to understand your purpose. I look forward to seeing more of your entries:)', '2021-04-10 05:46:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(7691465, 1260423, 3306, '<td valign="top">Congrats on you first entry. Not an easy one to start with but you have tackled it well. Nicely arranged and to the point.</td>', 'Congrats on you first entry. Not an easy one to start with but you have tackled it well. Nicely arranged and to the point.', '2021-04-10 05:50:09.000000', NULL, 0),
